{"id":"vod_lz_106881","vodId":"106881","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"机动战士高达0083 星尘的回忆","name_cn":"机动战士高达0083 星尘的回忆","date":"1991-01-01","year":"1991","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20250619-1/0ac3a0a4b7f9a0e5ecf915a5b381699a.jpg"},"summary":"一年战争已告一段落的三年后，基于地球联邦军重建计划而被提议的“高达开发计划”开始执行，其中的两台原型机RX-78GP01与RX-78GP02A为了实施性能测试而搬运至澳大利亚&quot托林顿&quot基地，但是吉恩残党查知此项计划，并且袭击该基地企图夺取装载有核弹的GP02A。曾经被称呼为“所罗门的恶梦”的吉恩军王牌机师阿纳贝尔•卡多少校（又译为阿纳贝鲁•卡图）成功的搭上了GP02A，但是在企图脱离的GP02A面前，新手测试驾驶员浦木宏驾驶了GP01拦阻，揭开了宇宙世纪0083年迪拉兹纷争的序幕。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-06-19 10:59:06","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v.lzcdn24.com/20250618/33703_9e9b3976/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v.lzcdn24.com/20250618/33704_884e580f/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v.lzcdn24.com/20250618/33705_04471c1f/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v.lzcdn24.com/20250618/33706_9c8fec7d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v.lzcdn24.com/20250618/33707_d7c8de30/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v.lzcdn24.com/20250618/33708_3fba5d7a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v.lzcdn24.com/20250618/33709_5366253b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v.lzcdn24.com/20250618/33710_d30f37aa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v.lzcdn24.com/20250618/33712_b5770ed1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v.lzcdn24.com/20250618/33711_f8ebbacc/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v.lzcdn24.com/20250618/33713_d9293db2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v.lzcdn24.com/20250618/33714_afeaad80/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v.lzcdn24.com/20250618/33715_679f5c43/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:42:34.928Z"}